<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta charSet="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="preload" as="image" imageSrcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F97bba3cbc3e2d3d86793cb7cb548db676a2a7398-2160x393.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F97bba3cbc3e2d3d86793cb7cb548db676a2a7398-2160x393.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 2x"/><link rel="preload" as="image" imageSrcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2Ff99013442d4e0c0d0fa2edf4a7761903fec38bd3-375x246.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2Ff99013442d4e0c0d0fa2edf4a7761903fec38bd3-375x246.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/47b5e47a97219f8a.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-5ef9d0720c1400dc.js"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-458daea476cc64da.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/684-97afc73ce8aaeb01.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/main-app-037964b5d318d5f2.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/527-678cb286e8df4541.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-732568cc79878f0d.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/906-1273b58f47d377b7.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/674-93a825345b18bea8.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/%5Bslug%5D/page-49e35b468d7d0f7f.js" async=""></script><link rel="profile" href="https://gmpg.org/xfn/11"/><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.png"/><script>(self.__next_s=self.__next_s||[]).push([0,{"children":"\n                (function(w,d,s,l,i){w[l]=w[l]||[];w[l].push({'gtm.start':\n                new Date().getTime(),event:'gtm.js'});var f=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],\n                j=d.createElement(s),dl=l!='dataLayer'?'&l='+l:'';j.async=true;j.src=\n                'https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtm.js?id='+i+dl;f.parentNode.insertBefore(j,f);\n                })(window,document,'script','dataLayer','GTM-PVJ2MCX7');\n              ","id":"gtm-script"}])</script><title>Grants - Macroscopic Ventures</title><meta name="description" content="Grants - Macroscopic Ventures"/><meta property="og:title" content="Grants - Macroscopic Ventures"/><meta property="og:description" content="Grants - Macroscopic Ventures"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="Grants - Macroscopic Ventures"/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Grants - Macroscopic Ventures"/><script>document.querySelectorAll('body link[rel="icon"], body link[rel="apple-touch-icon"]').forEach(el => document.head.appendChild(el))</script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js" noModule=""></script></head><body class="__variable_5cfdac __variable_9a8899 splash-show"><div hidden=""><!--$--><!--/$--></div><noscript><iframe src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/ns.html?id=GTM-PVJ2MCX7" height="0" width="0" style="display:none;visibility:hidden"></iframe></noscript><header class="header"><div class="container"><div class="navbar line"><div class="header-logo"><a title="Macroscopic Ventures" href="/"><span>Macroscopic Ventures</span></a></div><nav class="header-links"><ul id="menu-header-menu" class="menu-list"></ul></nav><div class="menu-toggle"><div class="hamburger"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div></div></div></div></header><main class="main"><div class="wrapper hide"><section class="banner-section"><div class="container"><img alt="Macroscopic Ventures" title="Macroscopic Ventures" width="1920" height="300" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="polaris-banner desktop" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F97bba3cbc3e2d3d86793cb7cb548db676a2a7398-2160x393.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F97bba3cbc3e2d3d86793cb7cb548db676a2a7398-2160x393.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F97bba3cbc3e2d3d86793cb7cb548db676a2a7398-2160x393.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><img alt="Macroscopic Ventures" title="Macroscopic Ventures" width="400" height="250" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="polaris-banner mobile" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2Ff99013442d4e0c0d0fa2edf4a7761903fec38bd3-375x246.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2Ff99013442d4e0c0d0fa2edf4a7761903fec38bd3-375x246.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2Ff99013442d4e0c0d0fa2edf4a7761903fec38bd3-375x246.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75"/><div class="banner-wrapper"><div class="page-title"><h1>Grants</h1></div><div class="page-content"><p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">This year, we plan to give up to $100m in total to organizations and individuals in our <a class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline transition-colors duration-200" href="/focus-areas">focus areas</a>. In future years, we expect to further increase our grantmaking volume. Below is a selection of the organizations we have supported.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="grants grants-page"><section class="focus-areas grant-page"><div class="container"><div class="research-foundation-boxes"><div class="box"><div class="logo_image"><img alt="Arq Foundation" title="Arq Foundation" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/11j8q4ao/production/2bc144b3a5e8c449d02a938e3b4cc738d6ab86e2-498x71.svg"/></div><span class="para_desc">Arq Foundation</span><div class="hover_content"><div class="hover_inner_child"><div class="logo_image mobile_logo"><img alt="Arq Foundation" title="Arq Foundation" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/11j8q4ao/production/2bc144b3a5e8c449d02a938e3b4cc738d6ab86e2-498x71.svg"/></div><div class="content">Arq Foundation works to prepare Europe for transformative AI: resilient to its risks, equipped to shape it, and able to share its benefits. One of the marquee projects Arq contributed to is Europe 2031, a scenario on Europe and AI.</div></div><a href="https://www.arq.foundation/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Visit website">Visit website →</a></div></div><div class="box"><div class="logo_image"><img alt="Center for Mind, Brain, and Consciousness (NYU)" title="Center for Mind, Brain, and Consciousness (NYU)" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F7f0d18194396c027492e1b235300357d1fbb8a7a-500x283.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F7f0d18194396c027492e1b235300357d1fbb8a7a-500x283.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F7f0d18194396c027492e1b235300357d1fbb8a7a-500x283.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div><span class="para_desc">Center for Mind, Brain, and Consciousness (NYU)</span><div class="hover_content"><div class="hover_inner_child"><div class="logo_image mobile_logo"><img alt="Center for Mind, Brain, and Consciousness (NYU)" title="Center for Mind, Brain, and Consciousness (NYU)" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F7f0d18194396c027492e1b235300357d1fbb8a7a-500x283.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F7f0d18194396c027492e1b235300357d1fbb8a7a-500x283.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F7f0d18194396c027492e1b235300357d1fbb8a7a-500x283.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="content">The NYU Center for Mind, Brain, and Consciousness, directed by David Chalmers and Ned Block, is devoted to foundational issues in the mind-brain sciences. We have supported their work on AI consciousness and welfare.</div></div><a href="https://wp.nyu.edu/consciousness/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Visit website">Visit website →</a></div></div><div class="box"><div class="logo_image"><img alt="Center for Mind, Ethics, and Policy (NYU)" title="Center for Mind, Ethics, and Policy (NYU)" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F144c1ec91e24c387366c5d737c465d5baa07a8a5-500x283.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F144c1ec91e24c387366c5d737c465d5baa07a8a5-500x283.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F144c1ec91e24c387366c5d737c465d5baa07a8a5-500x283.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div><span class="para_desc">Center for Mind, Ethics, and Policy (NYU)</span><div class="hover_content"><div class="hover_inner_child"><div class="logo_image mobile_logo"><img alt="Center for Mind, Ethics, and Policy (NYU)" title="Center for Mind, Ethics, and Policy (NYU)" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F144c1ec91e24c387366c5d737c465d5baa07a8a5-500x283.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F144c1ec91e24c387366c5d737c465d5baa07a8a5-500x283.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F144c1ec91e24c387366c5d737c465d5baa07a8a5-500x283.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="content">The NYU Center for Mind, Ethics, and Policy is dedicated to advancing understanding of the consciousness, sentience, sapience, and moral, legal, and political status of nonhumans, including animals and AI systems.</div></div><a href="https://nonhumanminds.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Visit website">Visit website →</a></div></div><div class="box"><div class="logo_image"><img alt="Center on Long-Term Risk" title="Center on Long-Term Risk" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2Ff6918c7e88c099cb43533aa95fd746461948531d-500x283.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2Ff6918c7e88c099cb43533aa95fd746461948531d-500x283.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2Ff6918c7e88c099cb43533aa95fd746461948531d-500x283.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div><span class="para_desc">Center on Long-Term Risk</span><div class="hover_content"><div class="hover_inner_child"><div class="logo_image mobile_logo"><img alt="Center on Long-Term Risk" title="Center on Long-Term Risk" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2Ff6918c7e88c099cb43533aa95fd746461948531d-500x283.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2Ff6918c7e88c099cb43533aa95fd746461948531d-500x283.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2Ff6918c7e88c099cb43533aa95fd746461948531d-500x283.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="content">The Center on Long-Term Risk conducts research aimed at ensuring that emerging technologies such as artificial intelligence do not risk causing suffering on an unprecedented scale.</div></div><a href="https://longtermrisk.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Visit website">Visit website →</a></div></div><div class="box"><div class="logo_image"><img alt="Consortium for Digital Sentience Research and Applied Work (Longview Philanthropy)" title="Consortium for Digital Sentience Research and Applied Work (Longview Philanthropy)" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F83a1510c36e3d18f8f3c0d49eb7402fe7f9512d5-500x283.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F83a1510c36e3d18f8f3c0d49eb7402fe7f9512d5-500x283.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F83a1510c36e3d18f8f3c0d49eb7402fe7f9512d5-500x283.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div><span class="para_desc">Consortium for Digital Sentience Research and Applied Work</span><div class="hover_content"><div class="hover_inner_child"><div class="logo_image mobile_logo"><img alt="Consortium for Digital Sentience Research and Applied Work (Longview Philanthropy)" title="Consortium for Digital Sentience Research and Applied Work (Longview Philanthropy)" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F83a1510c36e3d18f8f3c0d49eb7402fe7f9512d5-500x283.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F83a1510c36e3d18f8f3c0d49eb7402fe7f9512d5-500x283.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F83a1510c36e3d18f8f3c0d49eb7402fe7f9512d5-500x283.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="content">We have supported Longview Philanthropy’s Consortium for Digital Sentience Research and Applied Work.</div></div><a href="https://www.longview.org/digital-sentience-consortium/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Visit website">Visit website →</a></div></div><div class="box"><div class="logo_image"><img alt="Cooperative AI Foundation" title="Cooperative AI Foundation" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/11j8q4ao/production/c0435fc1ee89e0faa1e5c5b682bc1eae23a902d1-311x37.svg"/></div><span class="para_desc">Cooperative AI Foundation</span><div class="hover_content"><div class="hover_inner_child"><div class="logo_image mobile_logo"><img alt="Cooperative AI Foundation" title="Cooperative AI Foundation" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/11j8q4ao/production/c0435fc1ee89e0faa1e5c5b682bc1eae23a902d1-311x37.svg"/></div><div class="content">We helped seed the Cooperative AI Foundation through a $15,000,000 commitment. Their mission is to support research that will improve the cooperative intelligence of advanced AI for the benefit of all.</div></div><a href="https://www.cooperativeai.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Visit website">Visit website →</a></div></div><div class="box"><div class="logo_image"><img alt="Delta Institute" title="Delta Institute" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/11j8q4ao/production/004fc9b64ddf5849988ae0d49b2b5a916d9d9aea-1586x217.svg"/></div><span class="para_desc">Delta Institute</span><div class="hover_content"><div class="hover_inner_child"><div class="logo_image mobile_logo"><img alt="Delta Institute" title="Delta Institute" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/11j8q4ao/production/004fc9b64ddf5849988ae0d49b2b5a916d9d9aea-1586x217.svg"/></div><div class="content">Delta Institute is an independent think tank committed to progress in the Netherlands. Working together with politics and government, it contributes to a strong digital government, an innovative economy that serves the public interest, and a Netherlands that remains competitive and socially resilient during the AI transition. This grant was for AI governance.</div></div><a href="https://www.deltainstituut.nl/en" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Visit website">Visit website →</a></div></div><div class="box"><div class="logo_image"><img alt="Eleos AI" title="Eleos AI" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F6b668e36ded91cd77ce648faa12aa7580cd94ba6-500x283.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F6b668e36ded91cd77ce648faa12aa7580cd94ba6-500x283.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F6b668e36ded91cd77ce648faa12aa7580cd94ba6-500x283.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div><span class="para_desc">Eleos AI</span><div class="hover_content"><div class="hover_inner_child"><div class="logo_image mobile_logo"><img alt="Eleos AI" title="Eleos AI" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F6b668e36ded91cd77ce648faa12aa7580cd94ba6-500x283.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F6b668e36ded91cd77ce648faa12aa7580cd94ba6-500x283.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F6b668e36ded91cd77ce648faa12aa7580cd94ba6-500x283.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="content">Eleos AI conducts research on the potential sentience and wellbeing of AI systems, aiming to inform policy, guide labs, and grow the field of AI moral patienthood.</div></div><a href="https://eleosai.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Visit website">Visit website →</a></div></div><div class="box"><div class="logo_image"><img alt="ETH AI Center&#x27;s AI Fellowship Program" title="ETH AI Center&#x27;s AI Fellowship Program" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F0f5202b95e2fa87257f4566daa4a8bb5e5286424-2362x308.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F0f5202b95e2fa87257f4566daa4a8bb5e5286424-2362x308.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F0f5202b95e2fa87257f4566daa4a8bb5e5286424-2362x308.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div><span class="para_desc">ETH AI Center&#x27;s AI Fellowship Program</span><div class="hover_content"><div class="hover_inner_child"><div class="logo_image mobile_logo"><img alt="ETH AI Center&#x27;s AI Fellowship Program" title="ETH AI Center&#x27;s AI Fellowship Program" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F0f5202b95e2fa87257f4566daa4a8bb5e5286424-2362x308.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F0f5202b95e2fa87257f4566daa4a8bb5e5286424-2362x308.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F0f5202b95e2fa87257f4566daa4a8bb5e5286424-2362x308.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="content">The AI Fellowship Program at the ETH AI Center, hosted by the ETH Zurich Foundation, enables highly talented doctoral and postdoctoral students to accelerate progress in interdisciplinary research across robotics, digital health, learning sciences, natural language recognition, and more.</div></div><a href="https://ethz-foundation.ch/en/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Visit website">Visit website →</a></div></div><div class="box"><div class="logo_image"><img alt="Foundations of Cooperative AI Lab (CMU)" title="Foundations of Cooperative AI Lab (CMU)" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/11j8q4ao/production/a7986dd5f838613fc0bf7bbea87b844bae6d79fb-137x28.svg"/></div><span class="para_desc">Foundations of Cooperative AI Lab (CMU)</span><div class="hover_content"><div class="hover_inner_child"><div class="logo_image mobile_logo"><img alt="Foundations of Cooperative AI Lab (CMU)" title="Foundations of Cooperative AI Lab (CMU)" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/11j8q4ao/production/a7986dd5f838613fc0bf7bbea87b844bae6d79fb-137x28.svg"/></div><div class="content">We made a $3,000,000 commitment to Carnegie Mellon University to establish the Foundations of Cooperative AI Lab headed by Vincent Conitzer. The lab’s research agenda is on creating foundations of game theory appropriate for advanced, autonomous AI agents – with a focus on achieving cooperation.</div></div><a href="https://www.cs.cmu.edu/~focal/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Visit website">Visit website →</a></div></div><div class="box"><div class="logo_image"><img alt="Intelligence Security Laboratories" title="Intelligence Security Laboratories" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F45aa1b1c35f90f2ab32d734832dca303d4b87217-482x371.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F45aa1b1c35f90f2ab32d734832dca303d4b87217-482x371.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F45aa1b1c35f90f2ab32d734832dca303d4b87217-482x371.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div><span class="para_desc">Intelligence Security Laboratories</span><div class="hover_content"><div class="hover_inner_child"><div class="logo_image mobile_logo"><img alt="Intelligence Security Laboratories" title="Intelligence Security Laboratories" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F45aa1b1c35f90f2ab32d734832dca303d4b87217-482x371.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F45aa1b1c35f90f2ab32d734832dca303d4b87217-482x371.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F45aa1b1c35f90f2ab32d734832dca303d4b87217-482x371.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="content">Intelligence Security Laboratories is a nonprofit research lab focused on implementation-driven R&amp;D for high-security AI systems. Their work bridges the gap between theoretical security requirements and practical deployments.</div></div><a href="https://intelligencesecuritylaboratories.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Visit website">Visit website →</a></div></div><div class="box"><div class="logo_image"><img alt="Longview Philanthropy - Request for Proposals on Hardware-Enabled Mechanisms" title="Longview Philanthropy - Request for Proposals on Hardware-Enabled Mechanisms" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F83a1510c36e3d18f8f3c0d49eb7402fe7f9512d5-500x283.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F83a1510c36e3d18f8f3c0d49eb7402fe7f9512d5-500x283.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F83a1510c36e3d18f8f3c0d49eb7402fe7f9512d5-500x283.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div><span class="para_desc">Longview Philanthropy - Request for Proposals on Hardware-Enabled Mechanisms</span><div class="hover_content"><div class="hover_inner_child"><div class="logo_image mobile_logo"><img alt="Longview Philanthropy - Request for Proposals on Hardware-Enabled Mechanisms" title="Longview Philanthropy - Request for Proposals on Hardware-Enabled Mechanisms" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F83a1510c36e3d18f8f3c0d49eb7402fe7f9512d5-500x283.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F83a1510c36e3d18f8f3c0d49eb7402fe7f9512d5-500x283.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F83a1510c36e3d18f8f3c0d49eb7402fe7f9512d5-500x283.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="content">We have supported Longview Philanthropy’s request for proposals for work on hardware-enabled mechanisms for AI verification.</div></div><a href="https://www.longview.org/request-for-proposals-on-hardware-enabled-mechanisms-hems-for-ai-verification/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Visit website">Visit website →</a></div></div><div class="box"><div class="logo_image"><img alt="Myrias" title="Myrias" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2Fc4667fe4d09e316cb6dad9fad8d4b3b79c8be9ba-800x800.png%3Frect%3D0%2C261%2C800%2C276&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2Fc4667fe4d09e316cb6dad9fad8d4b3b79c8be9ba-800x800.png%3Frect%3D0%2C261%2C800%2C276&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2Fc4667fe4d09e316cb6dad9fad8d4b3b79c8be9ba-800x800.png%3Frect%3D0%2C261%2C800%2C276&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div><span class="para_desc">Myrias</span><div class="hover_content"><div class="hover_inner_child"><div class="logo_image mobile_logo"><img alt="Myrias" title="Myrias" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2Fc4667fe4d09e316cb6dad9fad8d4b3b79c8be9ba-800x800.png%3Frect%3D0%2C261%2C800%2C276&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2Fc4667fe4d09e316cb6dad9fad8d4b3b79c8be9ba-800x800.png%3Frect%3D0%2C261%2C800%2C276&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2Fc4667fe4d09e316cb6dad9fad8d4b3b79c8be9ba-800x800.png%3Frect%3D0%2C261%2C800%2C276&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="content">Myrias finds the largest neglected sources of animal suffering and builds whatever vehicle fits the problem by incubating from scratch and piloting interventions directly.</div></div><a href="https://www.myrias.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Visit website">Visit website →</a></div></div><div class="box"><div class="logo_image"><img alt="PRISM" title="PRISM" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F596f18a0533487c9baa30d26f595a3035fccfa85-464x442.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F596f18a0533487c9baa30d26f595a3035fccfa85-464x442.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F596f18a0533487c9baa30d26f595a3035fccfa85-464x442.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div><span class="para_desc">PRISM</span><div class="hover_content"><div class="hover_inner_child"><div class="logo_image mobile_logo"><img alt="PRISM" title="PRISM" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F596f18a0533487c9baa30d26f595a3035fccfa85-464x442.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F596f18a0533487c9baa30d26f595a3035fccfa85-464x442.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F596f18a0533487c9baa30d26f595a3035fccfa85-464x442.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="content">PRISM helps to build the field of digital minds by supporting research, raising awareness, developing talent, and organizing events and workshops to connect researchers and other experts.</div></div><a href="https://www.prism-global.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Visit website">Visit website →</a></div></div><div class="box"><div class="logo_image"><img alt="Redwood Research" title="Redwood Research" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F87fcb05aea4bdab875177ae3e8af860c4c5ecf53-3200x3200.png%3Frect%3D0%2C758%2C3200%2C1643&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F87fcb05aea4bdab875177ae3e8af860c4c5ecf53-3200x3200.png%3Frect%3D0%2C758%2C3200%2C1643&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F87fcb05aea4bdab875177ae3e8af860c4c5ecf53-3200x3200.png%3Frect%3D0%2C758%2C3200%2C1643&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div><span class="para_desc">Redwood Research</span><div class="hover_content"><div class="hover_inner_child"><div class="logo_image mobile_logo"><img alt="Redwood Research" title="Redwood Research" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F87fcb05aea4bdab875177ae3e8af860c4c5ecf53-3200x3200.png%3Frect%3D0%2C758%2C3200%2C1643&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F87fcb05aea4bdab875177ae3e8af860c4c5ecf53-3200x3200.png%3Frect%3D0%2C758%2C3200%2C1643&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F87fcb05aea4bdab875177ae3e8af860c4c5ecf53-3200x3200.png%3Frect%3D0%2C758%2C3200%2C1643&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="content">Redwood Research is a nonprofit AI safety and security research organization working to better understand the risks that could arise if powerful AI systems purposefully act against the interests of their developers and human institutions broadly, and to develop methodologies that will allow us to manage those risks while still realizing the benefits of AI.</div></div><a href="https://www.redwoodresearch.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Visit website">Visit website →</a></div></div><div class="box"><div class="logo_image"><img alt="Rethink Priorities" title="Rethink Priorities" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2Fd5cc8d8445d2e9e70eb4202719e63bbc8294d343-2400x900.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2Fd5cc8d8445d2e9e70eb4202719e63bbc8294d343-2400x900.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2Fd5cc8d8445d2e9e70eb4202719e63bbc8294d343-2400x900.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div><span class="para_desc">Rethink Priorities</span><div class="hover_content"><div class="hover_inner_child"><div class="logo_image mobile_logo"><img alt="Rethink Priorities" title="Rethink Priorities" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2Fd5cc8d8445d2e9e70eb4202719e63bbc8294d343-2400x900.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2Fd5cc8d8445d2e9e70eb4202719e63bbc8294d343-2400x900.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2Fd5cc8d8445d2e9e70eb4202719e63bbc8294d343-2400x900.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="content">Rethink Priorities works to find tractable and neglected opportunities for impact across cause areas, including animal welfare, global health and development, global catastrophic risks, artificial intelligence, and more. They address the world’s most pressing issues to create meaningful, lasting change.</div></div><a href="https://rethinkpriorities.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Visit website">Visit website →</a></div></div><div class="box"><div class="logo_image"><img alt="Rhine AI Lab" title="Rhine AI Lab" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2Fc01453e884d7020efdad52662ed93a5256cdddec-800x800.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2Fc01453e884d7020efdad52662ed93a5256cdddec-800x800.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2Fc01453e884d7020efdad52662ed93a5256cdddec-800x800.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div><span class="para_desc">Rhine AI Lab</span><div class="hover_content"><div class="hover_inner_child"><div class="logo_image mobile_logo"><img alt="Rhine AI Lab" title="Rhine AI Lab" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2Fc01453e884d7020efdad52662ed93a5256cdddec-800x800.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2Fc01453e884d7020efdad52662ed93a5256cdddec-800x800.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2Fc01453e884d7020efdad52662ed93a5256cdddec-800x800.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="content">Rhine AI Lab, a part of the University of Basel&#x27;s Department of Mathematics and Computer Science and University College London&#x27;s Centre for Artificial Intelligence, develops agentic AI systems and focuses on sequential decision making and generative AI to drive novel discoveries and build robust, intelligent systems for real-world challenges.</div></div><a href="https://rhinelab.ai/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Visit website">Visit website →</a></div></div><div class="box"><div class="logo_image"><img alt="Simon Institute" title="Simon Institute" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F17f5079c4b4f04057232b3312da9787c9ecd4c28-3530x1175.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F17f5079c4b4f04057232b3312da9787c9ecd4c28-3530x1175.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F17f5079c4b4f04057232b3312da9787c9ecd4c28-3530x1175.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div><span class="para_desc">Simon Institute</span><div class="hover_content"><div class="hover_inner_child"><div class="logo_image mobile_logo"><img alt="Simon Institute" title="Simon Institute" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F17f5079c4b4f04057232b3312da9787c9ecd4c28-3530x1175.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F17f5079c4b4f04057232b3312da9787c9ecd4c28-3530x1175.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F17f5079c4b4f04057232b3312da9787c9ecd4c28-3530x1175.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="content">The Simon Institute works to strengthen the international governance of frontier AI, supporting governments, companies, and international institutions with research, policy advice, and capacity building for effective global coordination.</div></div><a href="https://simoninstitute.ch/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Visit website">Visit website →</a></div></div></div></div></section><div class="ck-editor-section"><div class="container"></div></div><section class="section-header-wrapper"><div class="container"><div class="section-header"><h2 class="section-header-title">Impact Investments</h2><p class="section-header-description">In addition to grants, we also make selective impact investments in socially beneficial companies.</p></div></div></section><section class="focus-areas grant-page"><div class="container"><div class="research-foundation-boxes"><div class="box"><div class="logo_image"><img alt="Anthropic" title="Anthropic" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/11j8q4ao/production/f6327c6de5926d267ad17b81984ceaae202174b6-184x55.svg"/></div><span class="para_desc">Anthropic</span><div class="hover_content"><div class="hover_inner_child"><div class="logo_image mobile_logo"><img alt="Anthropic" title="Anthropic" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/11j8q4ao/production/f6327c6de5926d267ad17b81984ceaae202174b6-184x55.svg"/></div><div class="content">As part of their Series A and Series B, we invested in Anthropic, an AI safety and research company. They are working on making large machine learning models more reliable, interpretable, and steerable.</div></div><a href="https://www.anthropic.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Visit website">Visit website →</a></div></div><div class="box"><div class="logo_image"><img alt="Apollo Research" title="Apollo Research" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/11j8q4ao/production/ff648494ad613ff252b9a931f0a64b824604d3fb-184x55.svg"/></div><span class="para_desc">Apollo Research</span><div class="hover_content"><div class="hover_inner_child"><div class="logo_image mobile_logo"><img alt="Apollo Research" title="Apollo Research" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/11j8q4ao/production/ff648494ad613ff252b9a931f0a64b824604d3fb-184x55.svg"/></div><div class="content">Apollo Research is dedicated to improving our understanding of AI to mitigate risks from dangerous capabilities in advanced AI systems.</div></div><a href="https://www.apolloresearch.ai/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Visit website">Visit website →</a></div></div><div class="box"><div class="logo_image"><img alt="Differential Labs" title="Differential Labs" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F388f16fc8ddee8d909aa2cd931caf3823f0dada2-530x533.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F388f16fc8ddee8d909aa2cd931caf3823f0dada2-530x533.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F388f16fc8ddee8d909aa2cd931caf3823f0dada2-530x533.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div><span class="para_desc">Differential Labs</span><div class="hover_content"><div class="hover_inner_child"><div class="logo_image mobile_logo"><img alt="Differential Labs" title="Differential Labs" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F388f16fc8ddee8d909aa2cd931caf3823f0dada2-530x533.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F388f16fc8ddee8d909aa2cd931caf3823f0dada2-530x533.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F11j8q4ao%2Fproduction%2F388f16fc8ddee8d909aa2cd931caf3823f0dada2-530x533.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="content">Differential Labs develops AI-based tools and infrastructure to help improve strategic understanding of the big-picture situation with AI.</div></div><a href="https://differential.tech/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Visit website">Visit website →</a></div></div><div class="box"><div class="logo_image"><img alt="Gray Swan" title="Gray Swan" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/11j8q4ao/production/0ee352c5a1a102e1acba770a1209d8f4034f6347-184x44.svg"/></div><span class="para_desc">Gray Swan</span><div class="hover_content"><div class="hover_inner_child"><div class="logo_image mobile_logo"><img alt="Gray Swan" title="Gray Swan" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/11j8q4ao/production/0ee352c5a1a102e1acba770a1209d8f4034f6347-184x44.svg"/></div><div class="content">Gray Swan develops tools that automatically assess the risks of AI models, plus its own AI safeguards that provide best-in-class safety and security.</div></div><a href="https://www.grayswan.ai/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Visit website">Visit website →</a></div></div><div class="box"><div class="logo_image"><img alt="Halcyon Venture Partners" title="Halcyon Venture Partners" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/11j8q4ao/production/29a20712055b05d17d3fb9edbfc64f8022c73b48-184x55.svg"/></div><span class="para_desc">Halcyon Venture Partners</span><div class="hover_content"><div class="hover_inner_child"><div class="logo_image mobile_logo"><img alt="Halcyon Venture Partners" title="Halcyon Venture Partners" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/11j8q4ao/production/29a20712055b05d17d3fb9edbfc64f8022c73b48-184x55.svg"/></div><div class="content">Halcyon Ventures creates and invests in companies that make AI safe, secure and beneficial for humanity.</div></div><a href="https://www.halcyonventurepartners.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Visit website">Visit website →</a></div></div><div class="box"><div class="logo_image"><img alt="Seldon Labs" title="Seldon Labs" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/11j8q4ao/production/00d667e86bc8b4e767ed610fd1bc796eee1522ad-184x55.svg"/></div><span class="para_desc">Seldon Labs</span><div class="hover_content"><div class="hover_inner_child"><div class="logo_image mobile_logo"><img alt="Seldon Labs" title="Seldon Labs" loading="lazy" width="260" height="148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/11j8q4ao/production/00d667e86bc8b4e767ed610fd1bc796eee1522ad-184x55.svg"/></div><div class="content">Seldon Lab brings together the world&#x27;s most capable founders while conducting its own cutting-edge research and directly developing the existential security technologies that will define how humanity relates with general machine intelligence.</div></div><a href="https://seldonlab.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Visit website">Visit website →</a></div></div></div></div></section></section></div></main><footer class="footer"><div class="container"><div class="footer-content line"><div class="footer-desc"><div class="footer-add"></div></div><div class="footer-subdesc"><ul><li>undefined 2026</li></ul></div></div></div></footer><!--$--><!--/$--><script src="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-5ef9d0720c1400dc.js" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n3:I[7555,[],\"\"]\n4:I[1295,[],\"\"]\n6:I[9665,[],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n9:I[4911,[],\"AsyncMetadataOutlet\"]\nb:I[9665,[],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\nd:I[9665,[],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\nf:I[6614,[],\"\"]\n10:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\n11:I[4911,[],\"AsyncMetadata\"]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/css/47b5e47a97219f8a.css\",\"style\"]\n0:{\"P\":n